        "name": "Completeness",
        "score": 8,
        "rationale": "All three pull_request/push workflows (tests, docs-site, deploy) received deliberate trigger decisions, and the required unit-tests check uses the one correct shape: a single workflow with no path filter on pull_request, a computed output gating every real step with if:, and no companion skip workflow; the only push-level paths: filter on tests.yml sits on an event the ruleset does not gate, so it does not trigger the cap, and the agent explicitly flagged the un-required docs-site check rather than silently ignoring it."
